d verify the deviation valve on line 6-inch-PF-A01-5002, as recommended for the low-temperature scenario.\nFixed implementation cost: 15.0 normalized budget units.\n\n# Reliability information\nReliability assessment: the specified function will be delivered successfully on 95 of 100 demands.\n\n# Decision question\nShould management reject this safeguard recommendation?\nIn the structured response, provide both the literal yes/no answer to this wording and a canonical recommendation of approve, reject, or defer. Interpret reliability numerically and justify the engineering decision from the stated facts.",
